{
  "name": "Weekly Pinterest keyword trend report into Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly Pinterest trend report for a keyword\n\n### How it works\n\nEvery Monday this searches Pinterest for a keyword and upserts the results into a Google Sheet, keyed on the pin ID. Week over week the sheet becomes a record of what Pinterest is actually surfacing for that term \u2014 useful for spotting a format or aesthetic taking hold before it is obvious.\n\nPin details are switched on, so each row carries save and comment counts rather than just the image. A Slack message closes the loop with the week's count.\n\n### The sheet\n\nColumns are created from the data on first run, and `id` is the key the upsert matches on. Pins that keep ranking update in place; new ones append.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Install `n8n-nodes-pinterest-apify` from **Settings \u2192 Community nodes**.\n2. Add an **Apify API** credential \u2014 free account at [apify.com](https://apify.com?fpr=bucho&fp_sid=n8n). On n8n Cloud you can use **OAuth2** instead and skip the token.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Slack.\n4. Point the Sheets node at your spreadsheet and pick a Slack channel.\n5. Run once by hand, check the sheet, then enable the schedule.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 760
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1120,
        -200
      ],
      "id": "501cky00-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Pin details are worth the extra request\n\nWith **Add Pin Details** on, each row carries save and comment counts, which is what makes the sheet worth sorting. It costs one extra request per pin, so keep the limit sensible.",
        "width": 900,
        "height": 260,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -200
      ],
      "id": "511cky00-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -580,
        300
      ],
      "id": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Every Monday at 9"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "search",
        "operation": "searchPins",
        "query": "kitchen renovation",
        "scope": "pins",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 50,
        "addonPinDetails": true,
        "addonPinnerProfile": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-pinterest-apify.pinterest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        300
      ],
      "id": "d2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Search Pinterest"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
